speechtext:
Resolution agreed to.
21. (a) That in respect of persons other than corporations the tax for 1945 be -reduced by 4 per cent of the aggregate of the normal tax, the graduated tax and the investment surtax;
(b) That in respect of persons other than corporations the tax -for 1946 be reduced by 16 per cent of the aggregate of the normal tax, the graduated tax and the investment surtax.
